>9. Does it matter what ring-finger you use?
>	No.  Just nethack's way of keeping track.

If you wield a cursed weapon, it welds itself to your right hand, and you
cannot remove that ring. I would expect that two-handed cursed weapons prevent
you from removing either ring. So if you are wearing a ring you might want to
remove quickly (polymorph, for example), it can help if it is on the left
hand.

